  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2d46eadaa73127df6727327",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "保持干劲在【绝好调】的状态出战GⅡ或GⅠ级别比赛15次以上，\\n在包括菊花赏的GⅡ以上赛事中取得3连胜",
      "source_fingerprint": "30c94ac2d832ca11f46e3e6aef3ed1c95b375c7b01bdb3e6d0028c03239e7690",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "79"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fabd1ed50d8948e19ffcf4e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在发生了焦躁的比赛中取得三次胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ded27647282fb63971b24c8ef077b7cb6db8ed1724c415684e68af2d4ee2496",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "8"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef7f5e00c2d9670c9527142e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在出道战以8马身差以上取胜，\\n并以人气第1取得朝日杯未来锦标、皋月赏、日本德比、菊花赏的胜利",
      "source_fingerprint": "b41460bf289a1228df76c780b272a3d45b1f1bf4f2c8d0787cba055cb7440453",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "80"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33c6ede90428f9e150d5e967",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在GⅠ级别比赛中取得三次第三名，且粉丝数达到32万以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb20fc770fc0fb42f4e4755956308ba05bf43b4f73f698298865d75e50e66fa5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "81"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfea039fa1ff6c78f54819db",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "拥有目白之名的赛马娘取得一次以上GⅠ级别比赛的胜利，\\n并取得菊花赏、宝冢纪念、有马纪念的胜利，\\n且粉丝数达到24万以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "cab1401794061dc7db7a79ad8d1236675dfe32df69813b3151593cc74a394024",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "82"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8693c05be650a5df82bd5f57",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在包括独角兽锦标、安田纪念的英里重赏比赛中取得5次以上胜利，\\n其中有1次以上是雨天，\\n并在英里冠军赛中以5马身以上差距取得胜利",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e493a5f984580ace36deea4fd002e12ad144db9f9c9df688df7cb3ebcf05ab2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "83"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:223ef12b397b2bfc5848403a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "参加GⅠ级别比赛获得人气第一6次以上，\\n并取得英里冠军赛、安田纪念、有马纪念胜利，\\n且粉丝数达到24万以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "d77ba37393a9ef2f266c7da10008ee2257dea7bebef7dc6c7b45dec96d6915eb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "84"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5639cd1676eb2115ded55a5a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "使用作战「追赶」且以人气第1保持连胜并取得重赏比赛6胜以上，\\n其中至少要有2场在最终直线超越5人以上取胜",
      "source_fingerprint": "36bb4a8c87ef2f2a10cb28d611578d69611f0a86286c5c7dc448ff70730cedf5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "85"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b7dae5fe5e02bd720af8634a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "保持连胜并在包括天皇赏(春)、宝冢纪念、天皇赏(秋)、\\n日本杯、有马纪念的重赏中取得8次以上胜利",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4b0d03b45e9e528b7dda5057a2f34e340164f8bb90ebdfccb8a9d7d4044750d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "86"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4f9fc4783daca0fb3ab8ca9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "使用作战「领放」并以无败状态在朝日杯未来锦标、皋月赏、日本德比中\\n以人气第1获胜，耐力达到1200以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cdf7050553e1959aefbb00db0fee53cbbff43111d32a218c9322ae320edd128",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "87"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b7760e7585eba233f43accb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "使用作战「领放」保持连胜，并在包含JBC经典赛、帝王赏、东京大赏典的\\n沙土重赏赛事(GⅠ、GⅡ和GⅢ)中取得至少9次胜利",
      "source_fingerprint": "08ced1e9677ca554f480a223d97094dc1a0a86d8f71ed8dedeb35a2b982e2205",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "88"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe24f5e4d1d5985ad45befe7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "于包含短途马锦标及高松宫纪念的\\n1200m比赛中获得9胜以上，\\n并且粉丝数达到240000人以上",
      "source_fingerprint": "a771c4154608d798060d7a2ddbb58734d2ca2d46b597d7ed3bef13a09e1c2fc6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "89"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:61ccac167422cd601be816d1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "继承来源双方皆为在育成过程中未取得过重赏胜利的赛马娘，\\n在继承心意后取得GⅠ胜利",
      "source_fingerprint": "c47a9d946e0d4d89a6d1fda1307bcbdb71d75641fd40a1f9858841be5accc017",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "9"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a33a73ceb43eb53ebae0ff77",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在草地与沙土的GⅠ级别比赛中各取得3次以上胜利",
      "source_fingerprint": "5865ca2e382e7dd4a2591d9c5d18799f9b95401c71b2176491522b0de0620d4d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "90"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3e9eecb85d8af981543157b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在樱花赏、NHK英里杯、维多利亚英里赛、\\n英里冠军赛、安田纪念5场比赛中均以人气第一的状态赢得全部胜利",
      "source_fingerprint": "73d63e4e88effd86f5f054f350ad6d8c3a4a5329052c9eb70bb1866b558f8005",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "91"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:558f588d618b65f0e8a2005b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "参加出道战",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac044db25dbf87c42af344eabb1a3507abfa308b118bdd0f5c7789668360a769",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "92"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4765324c36e2ab1d61ebae71",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "度过了一段宝贵的时光，感受到了不可替代的牵绊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce5a7fc9d11f88e987688b18be13bc9d4babd399db96fe7b1c391f691e8b1086",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "97"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68c76a6e4a0503efeb836012",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在URA总决赛中获胜",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb52107c276304f975ad858eda7302dde1734f16a0f6b27cdd2c9058900b2fc9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "98"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5424d38ae3f6b1de1641da66",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "取得樱花赏、日本橡树大赛、秋华赏的胜利",
      "source_fingerprint": "873a94d8dc537bc5c87b926db9a35e18e8bf05c5d25f081b1046715f6598d4c3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "131",
        "99"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ac134952e7358006d23bbc0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "优胜礼",
      "source_fingerprint": "10756bfb634e78d51c03c90fbdcc9130817040063ab5a96413be981f0a0433d3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
